  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egesire gekoiranigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa b’ababani bagateebia Elisha: “Rora aase aiga tomenyete inse y’oboteneneri bwao igo are aake mono ase tore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga togende goika Yorodani, na kera oyomo ageche omote oyomo aroro, erinde toagachere enyomba aroro tokomenya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akairaneria: “Genda!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo obo akamoteebia: “Koranche, ogende amo naintwe abasomba bao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akamoiraneria: “Ee, ningende amo nainwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio akagenda amo nabarabwo, na ekero baigete Yorodani, bakagecha emete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero oyomo obo arenge kogecha omote, egesire kegasomoka korwa ase omote, gekagwa ase amaache ime. Omonto oria akarera: “Obee, omonene one! Egesire eke nigo giasabetwe korwa ase omonto onde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria o Nyasae akamobooria: “Ng’ai kiagwera?” Ekero omonto oria amworogetie aase aria, Elisha akanacha egete, agakeruta gochia imeo, akagera egesire keria kegacheng’enena amaache igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akamoteebia: “Keimokie!” Na omonto oria akarambora okoboko kwaye, agakeimokia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abarwani b’Abasiiria bakobugwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eyemo ekero omorwoti bw’Abasiiria arenge korwana chiseegi n’Abaisraeli, agasemania nabasomba baye, agachora aase gete akobeeka egetwori kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omonto oria o Nyasae agatoma amang’ana ase omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akamoteebia: “Bwerende, tobaisa goetera aase aiga, ekiagera Abasiiria nao bakare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli agatoma abanto gochia aase aria omonto oria o Nyasae amotebetie ase okomokuurera. Na omorwoti agetooria, tari engaki eyemo gose ibere, korende chinyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti bw’Abasiiria akaba oichaanete ase ebirengererio biaye; akarangeria abasomba baye, akababoria: “Inee! Timokonyara gonteebiamonto ki ase egati yaito ore ensemo y’omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo bw’abasomba baye akamoiraneria: “Onde tari aa ase tore, aye omorwoti omonene one, korende n’Elisha, omobani ore agwo ase Abaisraeli, nere ogoteebia omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli amang’ana ogokwana ekero ore ase akanyomba kao g’okorara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agateeba: “Genda morigie aase amenyete, erio ntome abanto bamobwate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakamoteebia ng’a naaria Dotani amenyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo omorwoti agatoma gochia aroro chibarasi, ne chigari, na omoganda omonene bw’abasikari, na barabwo bagaika aroro botuko, bakanaaria omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omosomba bw’omonto oria o Nyasae abogeete mambia chuni, agasoka isiko, akarora omoganda oria bw’abasikari, amo ne chigari ne chibarasi, agateeba: “Obee, omonene one! Ninki togokora?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agateebia omosomba oye: “Tibwoboa, ekiagera abwo bare amo naintwe nigo bare abange goetania baria bare nabarabwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Elisha agasaba, akabora: “Aye Omonene, nagosabire, ramokia amaiso aye, erinde arore.” Na Omonene akaramokia amaiso ’omosae oria, nere akarora chibarasi ne chigari chi’omorero nigo chiaichire ekegoro igoro, chietanaine Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abasiiria bachete korwania Elisha, nere agasaba Omonene, akabora: “Nagosabire, oukorie abanto aba.” Ase ayio Omonene akabaukoria koreng’ana buna Elisha asabeete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agateebia abanto baria: “Eye tari ero enchera, na omochie tari oro oyo; intunyane, nainche nimborokie omonto oria mokorigia.” Erio akabatang’ana gochia Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase obwango boria basoete Samaria, Elisha akabora: “Aye Omonene, ramokia amaiso ’abaanto aba, erinde banyare korora.” Omonene akaramokia amaiso abo, nabarabwo bakarora, bakenyora ng’a ngati‐gati ya Samaria baare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli aroche abanto baria, akabooria Elisha: “Tata, ndaita abanto aba? Ndabaita?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha akairaneria: “Yaya, tobaita. Inee! Noite abanto gwosire n’omoro oo gose nobota bwao? Bae endagera barie na amaache banywe, erio bairane, bagende ase omonene obo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo omorwoti akabaroiseria omoyega omonene, na ekero bakoorire koria na konywa, akabaa ribaga, na barabwo bakagenda ase omonene obo. Abasiiria baria tibairanete naende nebiombe biabo korwania Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okonaarigwa gwa Samaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba magega y’amang’ana ayio, Beni‐Hadadi, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, akaroberia abarwani baye b’esegi, akagenda akanaaria omochie o Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enchara enene yarenge agwo Samaria ekero keria bayonaaretie. Omotwe bw’etigere okaba okoonigwa ase rigori rie chisekeli chi’echifeta emerongo etano na etato, na amabi y’amaruma aisanete agatita akamo ase chisekeli chi’echifeta isano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli arenge gotaara ase orwaki igoro, omokungu oyomo akarera asare, agateeba: “Aye omorwoti, omonene one, inkonye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akamoiraneria: “Onye Omonene takogokonya, naki inche ndaoboseemia? Nkorwa ase ekeooreri, gose nkorwa ase egeteera gi’okomitera edivai?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akabooria omokungu oria: “Emechando yao nereri?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akamoiraneria: “Omokungu nare aa tore komo agantebia: Rituko ria reero tiga torie omwana oo, na ankio torie oyone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio tokaiyeka omwana one tokamoria. Ne rituko ria kabere nkamoteebia ng’a arente omwana oye tomorie, korende ere konya obisire omwana oye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti aigwete amang’ana ’omokuungu oria, agatandora chianga chiaye. Ere nigo arenge gotaara ase orwaki igoro, na abanto baarenge ang’e bakarora obegete chianga chi’echigunia korwa ime ase omobere oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na igo akabora: “Tiga Nyasae ang’e egesusuro bono na kogenderera onye omotwe bw’Elisha, mosinto o Safati, ogotigara igoro ase amareko aye rituko ria reero ritaraera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha nigo aikaransete nyomba mwaye ime, na abagaaka nigo baikaransete amo nere. Bono omorwoti agatoma omonto korwa ase obosio bwaye atang’ane, korende ekero omonto oria ataraikao, Elisha agateebia abagaaka baria: “Mwarorire buna omoiti oria atomire omonto ache abutore omotwe one? Ekero omonto oria agocha mosieke egesieri, mokebwate bokong’u tabaisa gosoa nyomba. Inee! Ebititiro bi’amagoro ’omonene oye tibiri komotunyana?” Ekero agendererete gokwana nabarabwo, omotomwa oria agacha asare, agateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emechando eye nigo yarure ase Omonene. Ninki rende nganyete inyore korwa ase Omonene?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
